The Voidheart is an orb about two feet across, lit from within with a violet glow and cased in overlapping dark scales that keep shifting under the hand. It hangs where it is set, held by a heavy inertia that resists being moved and carries it on once it is.

Standing near it feels like standing in the fane of a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]], though the place it belongs to lies on the far side of a tear in the [[Phenomena/Weave|weave]], past a room that mirrors a room of the real world. There it hangs above a great hand that has pulled itself out of the ground, and the void-things around it crawl toward it. Taken away from that place it takes the warmth with it: the air falls cold, the walls begin to come apart, and more things push through the gaps.

The Party took it out of that place through the tear that opened over the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]]'s dance floor.
